[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Betrayal at the Throne</h2>
<i>"'Tis wise to keep careful eye on your enemies, but 'tis wiser to keep eye on your friends."<br>
-- words of advice from Kaloan the Traitor</i>

<p> One of your chief advisors, Janvas, has betrayed you and taken over your fortress at Valdras. Your most trusted followers managed to secure your temple and some artillery, but things are looking bad. Janvas has thunder cannons ready to destroy your kingdom, if not for the sun barriers your followers constructed.

$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0

[BadTeamDead]
<h2>Miracle!</h2>
<p> With the help of your most trusted followers, you managed to recapture your kingdom and destroy the rebel Janvas. Nothing lies in your way to supreme victory over the remains of the Valdras Empire!

<$Config,Done{mission.fileName}=1>
$Button=Leave Missions,MissionAbort,1
$Button=Next Mission,MissionBegin,RblScen5

[Failed]
<h2>Betrayed...</h2>
<p>
Too worried with matters of war, you failed to see where the true threat was - the homeland. Your folly resulted in death as you've been quickly crushed by the army of Janvas. Better luck next time.

$Button=Continue,Tell,TryAgain

[END]